# Voice System Architecture

## VoiceRouteId — governed values only

```ts
// src/config/voiceRoutePreference.ts
export type VoiceRouteId = 'voicebox' | 'browser' | 'gemini';
//  voicebox = Voicebox local TTS (runs on device hardware)
//  browser  = Web Speech API / browser built-in TTS
//  gemini   = Gemini 2.5 TTS via @google/genai
```

**No other values.** Do not add new TTS routes without updating this type AND adding a corresponding engine implementation.

## Single-dispatch rule

All TTS routing flows through the `speak()` function in `App.tsx`. Never call a TTS engine directly from a component.

```ts
// ✅ CORRECT — route via speak() in App.tsx
const speak = async (text: string, overrideVoice?: string) => {
  const route = getVoiceRoute(); // reads from voiceRoutePreference.ts
  if (route === 'gemini') await geminiVoiceEngine.speak(text, overrideVoice);
  else if (route === 'voicebox') await sovereignEngine.speak(text, overrideVoice);
  else await browserEngine.speak(text, overrideVoice);
};

// ❌ WRONG — component calling TTS engine directly
function SomeComponent() {
  const engine = new BrowserVoiceEngine();
  await engine.speak('hello'); // bypasses routing
}
```

## VoiceEngine interface contract

Every TTS engine MUST implement `IVoiceEngine` from `src/core/io/VoiceEngine.ts`:

```ts
interface IVoiceEngine {
  startListening(): Promise<void>;
  stopListening(): Promise<void>;
  submitText(text: string): Promise<void>;
  speak(text: string, overrideVoice?: string): Promise<void>;
  onStatusChange?: (status: SystemStatus, detail?: string) => void;
  onTranscription?: (text: string, isFinal: boolean) => void;
  onAgentResponse?: (text: string) => void;
}
```

## voiceRoutePreference.ts — single source of truth

- `getVoiceRoute()` — reads `localStorage` key `aios_voice_route`, returns `VoiceRouteId`
- `setVoiceRoute(route)` — writes to `localStorage`
- Default route: `'gemini'` (falls back to `'gemini'` if no value stored)
- Do NOT read/write `aios_voice_route` from any other file

## Adding a new TTS engine

1. Create `src/core/io/YourVoiceEngine.ts` implementing `IVoiceEngine`
2. Add the route value to `VoiceRouteId` in `voiceRoutePreference.ts`
3. Add the dispatch case to `speak()` in `App.tsx`
4. Add a tile to `VoiceControlPanel.tsx` Model section
5. Update `AIOS-VOICE-TTS-ARCHITECTURE-STANDARD-001.md` in the governing docs
